{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Get tool records"},"description":"Get the full record of up to 5 tools: each capability with its input and output types, price and limits; API status, sign-up and auth; price tier and free tier; ways in (web API, SDKs, official MCP); docs, pricing and site links; terms; ranking; and the date it was checked. Takes slugs from search_tools, page URLs or tool names. Call it before writing integration code.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","properties":{"slugs":{"description":"1 to 5 tools: slugs from search_tools, easycando.com page URLs or tool names.","items":{"maxLength":300,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"maxItems":5,"minItems":1,"type":"array"}},"required":["slugs"],"type":"object"},"name":"get_tool","outputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"missing":{"description":"Each reference that matched no tool, with up to five suggested slugs.","items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"ref":{"type":"string"},"suggestions":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array"}},"required":["ref","suggestions"],"type":"object"},"type":"array"},"tools":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"also_through":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array"},"api_status":{"enum":["official-ga","official-beta","waitlist","partner-or-enterprise","unofficial","none"],"type":"string"},"auth":{"enum":["none","api-key","oauth","other"],"type":"string"},"capabilities":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"One thing the tool does. index is its position, from 0.","properties":{"in":{"items":{"description":"A type id, such as text, structured, code, query.","type":"string"},"type":"array"},"index":{"description":"The capability\u2019s position in the tool\u2019s capabilities in get_tool, counting from 0. A position, not a stable id.","maximum":9